<title>UK: DNIB sets 400 mln Danish crown bond due Dec 2002.</title>
<headline>DNIB sets 400 mln Danish crown bond due Dec 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BBL.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DE NATIONALE INVESTERINGSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    27.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE   S27.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
